                        <div class="animate-pulse inline-block bg-secondary/80 text-primary font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full px-4 py-1 mb-4">Servicio 24/7 disponible</div>
                        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 text-white leading-tight">
                            Iluminamos tu <span class="text-secondary">futuro</span> con soluciones eléctricas 
                            <span class="relative inline-block">
                                <span class="text-white">profesionales</span>
                                <svg class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 120" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                                    <path d="M0,0V46.29c47.79,22.2,103.59,32.17,158,28,70.36-5.37,136.33-33.31,206.8-37.5C438.64,32.43,512.34,53.67,583,72.05c69.27,18,138.3,24.88,209.4,13.08,36.15-6,69.85-17.84,104.45-29.34C989.49,25,1113-14.29,1200,52.47V0Z" opacity=".25" fill="#FFC300" class="shape-fill"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-white/90 max-w-lg">Brindamos servicios eléctricos de alta calidad para hogares, comercios e industrias en Junín y alrededores. Atención de emergencias las 24 horas.</p>
                        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                            <a href="contacto.html" class="group bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/90 text-primary font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg hover:shadow-secondary/50 hover:-translate-y-1">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                                </svg>
                                Solicitar servicio
